| 70        | `r.xadd(STREAM, event)`                       | STREAM (v2-safe)                    |
| 89        | `r.set(cursor_key, start)`                    | `cursor_key = _v2_key("cursor:…")`  |
| 137       | `r.set(cursor_key, end + 1)`                  | same                                |
| 207       | `r.set(last_ts_key, new_max_ts)`              | `last_ts_key = _v2_key("cursor:…")` |

